 static JSONObject states(JSONObject r){JSONObject s=new JSONObject();put(s,"foreign5",lt(r,"foreign",5));put(s,"foreign10",lt(r,"foreign",10));put(s,"foreign15",lt(r,"foreign",15));put(s,"big_down",lt(r,"big_delta",0));put(s,"small_up",gt(r,"small_delta",0));put(s,"short_up",gt(r,"short_delta",0));put(s,"margin_down",lt(r,"margin_delta",0));put(s,"foreign_down",lt(r,"foreign_delta",0));put(s,"small70",gt(r,"small",70));put(s,"short_ratio",gt(r,"short_ratio",30));put(s,"price100",gt(r,"close",100));Double c=n(r,"close"),o=n(r,"open");put(s,"red_down",c==null||o==null?null:c<o);put(s,"daily_down",lt(r,"change_pct",-3));put(s,"near_low",lt(r,"close_position",20));put(s,"volume500",gt(r,"lots",500));return s;}
 static JSONObject screen(Collection<JSONObject> rows,JSONArray selected){Set<String> sel=new HashSet<>();for(int i=0;i<selected.length();i++)sel.add(selected.optString(i));if(sel.isEmpty())throw new IllegalArgumentException("未選條件");ArrayList<JSONObject> list=new ArrayList<>();int fail=0,unknown=0,tw=0,tp=0;JSONObject missing=new JSONObject();for(JSONObject r:rows){if("TWSE".equals(r.optString("market")))tw++;else if("TPEX".equals(r.optString("market")))tp++;JSONObject s=states(r);boolean missingRequired=false,all=true;for(String k:sel){if(s.isNull(k)){missingRequired=true;put(missing,k,missing.optInt(k)+1);}all&=s.optBoolean(k,false);}if(missingRequired){unknown++;continue;}if(!all){fail++;continue;}JSONArray ex=new JSONArray();Iterator<String> keys=s.keys();while(keys.hasNext()){String k=keys.next();if(!k.startsWith("foreign")&&!sel.contains(k)&&s.optBoolean(k))ex.put(k);else if("foreign_down".equals(k)&&!sel.contains(k)&&s.optBoolean(k))ex.put(k);}put(r,"states",s);put(r,"matched",selected);put(r,"extra_hits",ex);list.add(r);}list.sort((a,b)->{int c=Integer.compare(b.optJSONArray("extra_hits").length(),a.optJSONArray("extra_hits").length());return c!=0?c:a.optString("symbol").compareTo(b.optString("symbol"));});JSONObject out=new JSONObject(),markets=new JSONObject();put(markets,"TWSE",tw);put(markets,"TPEX",tp);put(out,"markets",markets);put(out,"scanned",rows.size());put(out,"matched",list.size());put(out,"failed",fail);put(out,"unknown",unknown);put(out,"missing",missing);put(out,"results",new JSONArray(list));return out;}
 JSONObject run(JSONArray selected){Set<String> sel=new HashSet<>();for(int i=0;i<selected.length();i++)sel.add(selected.optString(i));universe("TWSE","https://openapi.twse.com.tw/v1/opendata/t187ap03_L");universe("TPEX",TP+"mopsfin_t187ap03_O");twQuotes();tpQuotes();twMargin();tpMargin();twForeign(sel.contains("foreign_down"));tpForeign(sel.contains("foreign_down"));tdcc(sel.contains("big_down")||sel.contains("small_up"));step("計算必要條件及缺失統計");JSONObject out=screen(rows.values(),selected);put(out,"as_of",today.toString());put(out,"errors",errors);put(out,"sources",sources);put(out,"complete",errors.length()==0&&out.optInt("unknown")==0&&out.optJSONObject("markets").optInt("TWSE")>100&&out.optJSONObject("markets").optInt("TPEX")>100);return out;}
